[% set role = name | replace('-', '_') -%]
# [[ name ]]

[[ description ]]

An Ansible role scaffolded by `ansari new --type ansible-role`.

## Requirements

Ansible [[ min_ansible_version ]] or newer.

## Role variables

| Variable | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `[[ role ]]_enabled` | `true` | Set to `false` to skip every task in this role. |

Prefix new variables with `[[ role ]]_`: ansible-lint's `var-naming` rule
requires role variables to carry the role name.

## Example playbook

```yaml
- name: Apply [[ role ]]
  hosts: all
  roles:
    - role: [[ name ]]
```

## Platforms
