## Development

```bash
yamllint .
ansible-lint        # production profile, configured in .ansible-lint
[% if with_molecule %]molecule test       # converge, idempotence, and verify in Docker
[% endif %]```

## Staying current

This repository carries `.ansari/manifest.yaml`. `ansari check` reports when the
template it came from has moved on and which generated files have been edited
here.
